# Optional local settings for the dashboard's detection step. Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) and
# uncomment only what differs from the standard layout, which needs no configuration:
#   checkpoints/unet_best.pth   the trained U-Net checkpoint
#   .venv-detect/               a Python environment with PyTorch (Scripts/python.exe or bin/python)
#   assets/images/              the radar image folder
# Real environment variables override this file. Relative paths are resolved from the repo root.

# GOG_CHECKPOINT=path/to/unet_best.pth
# GOG_DETECTION_PYTHON=path/to/python-with-torch
# GOG_IMAGE_DIR=assets/images/val
